     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Support for pagination</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">MODIFIE=
D</span></p>
      <p>GET /employees/{shortid}</p>
      <p>p.s. Formerly <em>GET /iiq/users/{userid}</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Get an employee access profile</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Response Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse=
-source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contr=
ol-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand sourc=
e</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: true; collapse: true">{
=09"firstName": "",
=09"lastName": "",
=09"email": "",
=09"language": "",
=09"profile": {
=09=09"shortId": "",=20
&nbsp; &nbsp; =09"active": boolean,
=09=09"lastLogin": "",
=09=09"defaultModule": "",=20
=09=09"assignment": {
=09=09=09"firm": "",
=09=09=09"rrcodes": [""],
=09=09=09"package": {
=09=09=09=09"name": "",
=09=09=09=09"featureSelections": [""]
=09=09=09},
=09=09=09"resources": [""],
=09=09=09"restrictedResources": [""]
=09=09}
=09},
&nbsp; &nbsp; "linkedProfiles": {
=09=09"oss": {
=09=09=09"id": "",
=09=09=09"proxyId": "",
=09=09=09"userId": "",
=09=09=09"groupId": ""
=09=09},
=09=09"r2": {"id": ""},
=09=09"external": [{
=09=09=09"username": "",
=09=09=09"lastLogin": "",
=09=09}]
=09}
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><strong><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved"=
>MODIFIED</span> <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">*</span></strong></p>
      <p>POST /employees</p>
      <p>p.s. Formerly <em>POST /iiq/users</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Create a new employee access profile</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Request Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse-=
source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contro=
l-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source=
</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: false; collapse: true">{
=09"firstName": "",
=09"lastName": "",
=09"email": "",
=09"language": "",
=09"profile": {
=09=09"shortId": "",=20
=09=09"active": boolean,=20
  &nbsp; =09"defaultModule": "",=20
&nbsp; &nbsp; =09"assignment": {
=09=09=09"firm": "",
=09=09=09"rrcodes": [""],
=09=09=09"package": {
=09=09=09=09"name": "",
=09=09=09=09"featureSelections": [""]
=09=09=09}
=09  &nbsp; }
=09}
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>If the person exists already OR an internal access profile exists a=
lready, this should return an error.</p>
     <p>Indeed, POST http method is <u><strong>not</strong></u> idempotent,=
 unlike PUT.</p>
     <p>Ref. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer.mozilla.o=
rg/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/POST" rel=3D"nofollow">https://dev=
eloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/POST</a></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">MODIFIE=
D</span> <strong><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">*</span></strong></p>
      <p>PUT /employees/{shortid}</p>
      <p>p.s. Formerly <em>PUT /iiq/users/{userid}</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Replace (or create) an employee access profile</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Request Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse-=
source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contro=
l-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source=
</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: false; collapse: true">{
=09"firstName": "",
=09"lastName": "",
=09"email": "",
=09"language": "",
=09"profile": {
=09=09"shortId": "",=20
=09=09"active": boolean,=20
  &nbsp; =09"defaultModule": "",=20
&nbsp; &nbsp; =09"assignment": {
=09=09=09"firm": "",
=09=09=09"rrcodes": [""],
=09=09=09"package": {
=09=09=09=09"name": "",
=09=09=09=09"featureSelections": [""]
=09=09=09}
=09  &nbsp; }
=09}
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>If none (i.e. person or internal access profile) exists, this shoul=
d <u><strong>not return</strong></u> an error but instead create the person=
 and/or access profile and return successful.</p>
     <p>Indeed, PUT http method is idempotent, unlike POST.</p>
     <p>Ref. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer.mozilla.o=
rg/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/PUT" rel=3D"nofollow">https://deve=
loper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/PUT</a></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">NEW</=
span></p>
      <p>PATCH /employees/{shortid}</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Modify an employee access profile field</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>e.g. Deactivate</p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Request Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse-=
source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contro=
l-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand source=
</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: false; collapse: true">{
=09"profile": {"active": false}
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Allow for nested updates (i.e. JSON Merge Pa=
tch,&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://datatracker.ietf.org/d=
oc/html/rfc7396" rel=3D"nofollow">RFC 7396</a>)</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.006</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge">PENDING</span></p>
      <p>DELETE /employees/{shortid}</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Delete an employee access profile</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>If one exists, this should return successful, detailing what was d=
eleted (i.e. HTTP 200).</p>
      <p>If none exists, this should&nbsp;<u><strong>not return</strong></u=
> an error but instead return successful with no detail (i.e. HTTP 204)</p>
      <p>Indeed, DELETE http method is idempotent, just like PUT.</p>
      <p>Ref. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://developer.mozilla.=
org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/DELETE" rel=3D"nofollow">https://=
developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Methods/DELETE</a></p>
      <p><strong>N.B. </strong>Implementation is&nbsp;<span class=3D"status=
-macro aui-lozenge">PENDING</span> user lifecycle refinement (e.g. Name res=
olution should work independently from the user record existing in the <em>=
Person</em> table)</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.007</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-error">REMOVED=
</span></p>
      <p>GET /iiq/users/accessGroups</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Not needed anymore</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><strong>*&nbsp;</strong><span style=3D"co=
lor:#172b4d;">Should we add support for&nbsp;multiple access profile update=
s? (e.g. multi-part upload, json array, ...)</span></span></p>
<h1 id=3D"ManageEmployeeAccess-Appendix">Appendix</h1>
